{"parse": {"title": "抓住未来", "pageid": 144218, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"抓住未来\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/51/Item-173857.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"抓住未来\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>抓住未来</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#173857</div></div><hr /><div>一段过往的掠影，一些时代的片段，一份珍贵的纪念。谨以此物，为见证诸多故事的朋友们献上诚挚的敬意。<br />可于个人信息界面作为头像使用。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">你以为这只是一个手套的复制品？不，它是你可靠的朋友——只要你愿意听它的话。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "抓住未来"}}